<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113592" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a covering for the hand, glove,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.230
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.8.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Clearch.
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>covering for the arm, loose sleeve,</i> such as the Persians
			wore, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικατήμενος χειρίδι πλέῃ
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρὶ διπλῇ</span> codd.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργυρίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.72
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.3.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLips.</u>
				40 iii 23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>; used also by the Gauls, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Oth.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; by tragedians, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>JTr.</u>
				41
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρίδιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Agathin.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.7.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.187
			</span></i>. (On the accent v. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.437
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειρῖδας</span> Od.l.c.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
